E-OOBE-03-NEG_refreshed_no_modal.png\nproject-control/docs/evidence/issue_20261102_02/runs/qa_05/raw_capture/TC-E2E-OOBE-03-POS_dashboard_toast.png\nproject-control/docs/evidence/issue_20261102_02/runs/qa_05/raw_capture/TC-E2E-OOBE-03-POS_step5_ready.png\nproject-control/docs/evidence/issue_20261102_02/runs/qa_05/raw_capture/TC-E2E-THEME-01_light_theme.png\nproject-control/docs/evidence/issue_20261102_02/runs/qa_05/raw_capture/binaries/anchor.bin\nproject-control/docs/evidence/issue_20261102_02/runs/qa_05/raw_capture/binaries/fw_mc.bin\nproject-control/docs/evidence/issue_20261102_02/runs/qa_05/raw_capture/binaries/fw_th.bin\nproject-control/docs/evidence/issue_20261102_02/runs/qa_05/raw_capture/build_firmware.log\nproject-control/docs/evidence/issue_20261102_02/runs/qa_05/raw_capture/e2e_browser.log\nproject-control/docs/evidence/issue_20261102_02/runs/qa_05/raw_capture/hot_unplug_trace.log\nproject-control/docs/evidence/issue_20261102_02/runs/qa_05/raw_capture/probe_flash.log\nproject-control/docs/evidence/issue_20261102_02/runs/qa_05/raw_capture/raw_hil_execution.log\nproject-control/docs/evidence/issue_20261102_02/runs/qa_05/raw_capture/raw_uart_traffic.log\nproject-control/docs/evidence/issue_20261102_02/runs/qa_05/raw_capture/runtime.log\nproject-control/docs/evidence/issue_20261102_02/runs/qa_05/raw_capture/temperature_snapshot.json\nproject-control/docs/evidence/issue_20261102_02/runs/qa_05/raw_capture/uart_frames.log\nproject-control/docs/evidence/issue_20261102_02/runs/qa_05/server_qa/checkout.log\nproject-control/docs/evidence/issue_20261102_02/runs/qa_05/server_qa/runtime.log\nproject-control/docs/evidence/issue_20261102_02/runs/qa_05/server_qa/server_lock.json\nproject-control/docs/evidence/issue_20261102_02/runs/qa_05/server_qa/server_qa.json\nproject-control/docs/evidence/issue_20261102_02/runs/qa_05/server_qa/server_verdict.json\nproject-control/docs/evidence/issue_20261102_02/runs/qa_05/sessions/codex_session.jsonl\nsoc-ap/contracts/minimcproto/casc